      "content": "That's a solid start, really atmospheric. However, I just ran it through our internal tracker and the score was actually pretty low. \n\nWe need to make sure the brand identity really sticks. Can you try another version for the same \"Rusted Iron Key\"? Try to weave in the title and that \"ancient\" theme a bit more effectively so the score definitely hits the target range. Just keep it looking like natural writing, don't make it obvious.",
